# Historical Mission 05 arrival-save probe with a superseded nine-turn prefix.
# The current original-backed fog gate rejects its initial waypoint (47,58).
# The old turn-9 arrival is retained evidence, not a validated starting point.
# If reached, save_slot asks the recovered saveGame writer for a slot-10
# DAT/FAC pair. This script currently proves neither arrival nor compatibility
# with the original clash95.exe `a` slot-10 auto-load; both need fresh validation.
include_script tests/first_campaign_arc_routes/mission_05_multiturn_march_probe.script

world_save_slot 10 2.0
wait_log 60 debug-save-written slot=10 ok=1
screenshot mission05-arrival-save-written
nonblank mission05-arrival-save-written
